    "section": "18. Transports",
    "ruleNumber": "18.05",
    "order": 218,
    "anchor": "18.05",
    "summary": "Units embarked in a **TRANSPORT** model that has just been **destroyed** make this move:\n\n1. Make one **[Hazard roll](vsdata:core-rule/hazard-rolls)** per model in the unit.\n2. Using [Set Up](vsdata:core-rule/set-up), place each model wholly within 6″ of the **TRANSPORT** and as close to it as possible, **unengaged**; if that is impossible, place it the same way but **engaged**. A model with no legal placement either way is destroyed.\n3. The unit becomes **Battle-shocked** and cannot declare a charge this turn.",
